# Mini App UX

- Customer UI is Russian. Keep the compact workspace: thread + composer 20–25%, options in the popup — see `docs/14-Telegram-Customer-UX.md`.
- Do not turn the Mini App into a marketing landing or a second owner console.
- Motion stays purposeful (existing gold/cyan voice). No generic AI-orb chrome.
- **Experience Layer / mascot events (Rive or similar):** Future. Do not add a mascot runtime, Rive dependency, or event bus in MVP. If a TZ later asks for delight beats, file `backlog/Future.md` or wait for an ADR.
- Visual rules: `.cursor/skills/anti-slop-design/SKILL.md`.
